@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PROVIDER_ADMIN_TOKEN
@packageId = REPLACE_WITH_RECEIPT_PACKAGE_ID
@candidateId = REPLACE_WITH_CANDIDATE_ID
@artifactId = REPLACE_WITH_ARTIFACT_ID
@previewId = REPLACE_WITH_PREVIEW_ID
@previewHash = REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_PREVIEW_HASH
@packageRevision = 1
@candidateRevision = 1
@referenceCandidateId = REPLACE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION_REFERENCE_CANDIDATE_ID
@referenceRevision = 1

### Durable onboarding receipt (before profile activation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/onboarding/atos/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Prefer: respond-async
Idempotency-Key: local-synthetic-package-v1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=package

--package
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="synthetic.json"
Content-Type: application/json

{"components":[{"id":"local-idp","name":"Synthetic identity provider","description":"Synthetic identity provider manages identities."}]}
--package--

### Active providers use the same multipart body at /api/csp/inherited-components/import.
### List provider-private receipts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Processing and publication state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manifest coverage and exceptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/entries?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Source-backed private candidates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recover persisted approval and publication after refresh or an uncertain response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/review-state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reviewed source references are not verified authorization decisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates?type=AuthorizationReference&reviewState=Reviewed&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Proposed source-reference metadata and immutable citations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates?type=AuthorizationReference&reviewState=NeedsReview&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review reference metadata, not an authorization decision (copy current candidate fields/revision)
# Reference names allow 1-2000 characters. Component classification is inapplicable; null is accepted.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates/{{referenceCandidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": {{referenceRevision}},
  "name": "Synthetic authorization memorandum",
  "description": "Source-stated reference; not a verified authorization or system ATO.",
  "componentType": null,
  "classification": "",
  "serviceCategory": "",
  "controlDuties": {},
  "contributorIds": [],
  "reviewAction": "Reviewed",
  "rationale": null,
  "duplicateResolution": null,
  "authorizationReference": {
    "reference": "SYNTHETIC-REFERENCE-01",
    "issuer": "Synthetic issuing office",
    "issuedAt": "2026-01-02T00:00:00Z",
    "expiresAt": "2027-01-02T00:00:00Z"
  }
}

### Reject a reference with rationale (refresh referenceRevision after every successful edit)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates/{{referenceCandidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": {{referenceRevision}},
  "name": "Synthetic authorization memorandum",
  "description": "Source-stated reference; not a verified authorization or system ATO.",
  "componentType": null,
  "classification": "",
  "serviceCategory": "",
  "controlDuties": {},
  "contributorIds": [],
  "reviewAction": "Rejected",
  "rationale": "Synthetic source reference withdrawn after review.",
  "duplicateResolution": null,
  "authorizationReference": null
}

### Rejected references remain retained but no longer appear in the Reviewed filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates?type=AuthorizationReference&reviewState=Rejected&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Protected attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicit human review (copy the exact current candidate fields first)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":{{candidateRevision}},"name":"Synthetic identity provider","description":"Synthetic identity provider manages identities.","componentType":"Identity","classification":"Unclassified","serviceCategory":"Identity","controlDuties":{},"contributorIds":[],"reviewAction":"Reviewed","rationale":null,"duplicateResolution":null}

### Exclude an irrelevant or unsupported source explicitly (invalidates approvals)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/entries/{{artifactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":1,"rationale":"Synthetic non-document container is outside the selected approval set."}

### Retry only failed/incomplete packages
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: local-retry-v1

### Preview exact reviewed selection, including component dependencies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/approval-previews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":{{packageRevision}},"candidates":[{"candidateId":"{{candidateId}}","revision":{{candidateRevision}}}]}

### Explicit approval
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"previewId":"{{previewId}}","previewHash":"{{previewHash}}","revision":{{packageRevision}}}

### Explicit publication; repeat with the identical key/body to verify replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/{{packageId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: local-publish-v1
Content-Type: application/json

{"previewId":"{{previewId}}","previewHash":"{{previewHash}}","revision":{{packageRevision}}}

### Missing source is 404, never an arbitrary file download
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/package-imports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
